{
  "content": "<h1><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Customers\">Customers</span> &mdash; <span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"QtyToDeliver\">Qty to deliver</span></h1><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Custom Customer Customers InventoryItem InventoryItems Is Item Pending Qty QtyToDeliver To ToDate\">The <em>Customers - Qty to Deliver</em> screen displays inventory items that are pending delivery to customers.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Create Delivered DeliveryNote DeliveryNotes Is Item Notes To ToDate\">This screen helps you track which items need to be delivered and allows you to create delivery notes efficiently.</p><h2 translate=\"true\" keywords=\"\">Accessing the Screen</h2><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Custom Customer Customers On Qty QtyToDeliver To ToDate\">To access the <em>Qty to Deliver</em> screen, go to the <strong>Customers</strong> tab.</p><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 inline-block pointer-events-none ltr:pr-8 rtl:pl-8\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-200 ltr:pl-8 rtl:pr-8\"><div class=\"border-x border-neutral-300 bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"border-y ltr:border-l rtl:border-r border-neutral-300 bg-white p-4 flex gap-2 items-center\"><i class=\"fas fa-users-class text-neutral-400\"></i><span class=\"font-semibold text-sm text-[#428bca]\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Customers\">Customers</span></span></div><div class=\"border-x border-neutral-300 bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Column Custom Customer On Qty QtyToDeliver To ToDate\">Then click the figure under the <strong>Qty to Deliver</strong> column for a specific customer.</p><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"QtyToDeliver\">Qty to deliver</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-t-white text-center p-2 text-[#428bca]\">55</div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Column Columns Edit EditColumns On Qty QtyToDeliver To ToDate\">If you do not see the <em>Qty to Deliver</em> column, you will need to enable it using the <strong>Edit Columns</strong> function.</p><h2 translate=\"true\" keywords=\"DeliveryNote DeliveryNotes Notes\">Creating Delivery Notes</h2><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"DeliveryNote DeliveryNotes From FromDate Is Notes\">Creating delivery notes from this screen is more efficient than creating them from scratch.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"InventoryItem InventoryItems Item On Select To ToDate\">Select the inventory items with non-zero quantities that you want to deliver.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"DeliveryNote Item NewDeliveryNote On Select To ToDate\">Click the <strong>New Delivery Note</strong> button to copy the selected items to a new delivery note.</p><h2 translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Custom Customer Customers To ToDate\">Working with Multiple Customers</h2><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Create Custom Customer Customers DeliveryNote DeliveryNotes Notes On Rent To ToDate\">You can create multiple delivery notes at once for different customers.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Custom Customer Customers InventoryItem InventoryItems Is Item Qty QtyToDeliver To ToDate\">This is useful when you want to clear the <em>Qty to Deliver</em> figures across all customers and inventory items.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"By Custom Customer Qty QtyToDeliver To ToDate\">By default, the screen shows <em>Qty to Deliver</em> figures for a specific customer.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Custom Customer Customers Filter Name Next On Pending To ToDate View\">To view pending deliveries for all customers, click the <strong>X</strong> button next to the customer's name to remove the filter.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Create DeliveryNote DeliveryNotes InventoryItem InventoryItems Item NewDeliveryNote Notes On Select To ToDate\">Then select the inventory items with non-zero quantities and click <strong>New Delivery Note</strong> to create delivery notes.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Automatic Create Custom Customer DeliveryNote DeliveryNotes Notes Rate To ToDate\">The system will automatically create separate delivery notes for each customer.</p><h2 translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Column On\">Column Information</h2><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Column Columns Contains On\">The screen contains the following columns:</p><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Customer\">Customer</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Customer\">Customer</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Custom Customer Pending To ToDate\">The customer to whom goods are pending delivery.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Code Custom Customer Is Name On To ToDate\">Displays both the customer code and name for easy identification.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Custom Customer Customers Is To ToDate View\">When viewing all customers, this helps identify which customers are awaiting deliveries.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"InventoryItem\">Inventory Item</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"InventoryItem\">Inventory Item</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"InventoryItem Is Item Pending To ToDate\">The <em>inventory item</em> that is pending delivery.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Code Is Item ItemCode Name On\">Displays both the item code and name for easy identification.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"QtyToDeliver\">Qty to deliver</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"QtyToDeliver\">Qty to deliver</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"InventoryItem Is Item Pending To ToDate\">The quantity of each <em>inventory item</em> that is pending delivery.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Custom Customer InventoryItem Item On To ToDate View\">Click the quantity figure to view the detailed delivery ledger for that specific customer and inventory item combination.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Column Is To ToDate Total\">The total quantity to deliver is shown at the bottom of the column.</p></div></details>",
  "key": "customers-qty-to-deliver"
